content.text:
Need verify result overlay CSS `result-grade` width changed and grid. Good.

Now test autoplay and gameplay. Reload first. Need fix possibly `getTrackAudio` fetch decode and server. Use page refresh. Then play Aurora, install autoplay. We'll evaluate after start. Need handle release for holds and taps. Because game keyboard press sets pressedLanes; autoplay direct game. Use `pressLane` and `releaseLane`. For tap release after 30ms. For hold auto-completes at end, but we need released after complete. `releaseLane` after completion finds activeHolds null; okay. Poll holds.
Script:
```
window.__auto = setInterval(()=>{
 const g=__pulse.game; if(!g.running||g.paused) return;
 const t=g.getSongTime();
 for(const n of g.notes){
   if(n.done||n.headJudged||Math.abs(n.time-t)>0.025) continue;
   if(g.activeHolds[n.lane]) continue;
   g.pressLane(n.lane);
   if(n.type==='tap') setTimeout(()=>g.releaseLane(n.lane), 26);
 }
 for(let lane=0;lane<4;lane++){const h=g.activeHolds[lane]; if(h && t>=h.endTime-0.08){g.releaseLane(lane)}}
},10)
```
Potential issue release after tap calls releaseLane and activeHolds null; okay.
- Notes times at 60s; test for maybe 15 sec and inspect score/perfect. But track 60s; we can let 20s. Might be CPU heavy but okay.
- Need start after reload.

Let's reload and click, wait 4s then install auto.

